# Temporary Files Directory
# 
# This directory stores temporary files during processing.
# 
# Types of temp files:
# - Uploaded files during compression/optimization
# - Generated previews before storage
# - Processing buffers for PDF operations
# 
# Cleaning policy:
# - Files older than 24 hours are automatically deleted
# - Cleanup runs hourly via Celery task
# - DO NOT store permanent data here
